# CPM runtime state lives outside the repo — never ~/.cpm.
# Canonical: %APPDATA%\coding-provider-manager (Windows),
# ~/.config/coding-provider-manager (Unix / $XDG_CONFIG_HOME).
# Ignore accidental workspace copies / legacy names:
.config/coding-provider-manager/
AppData/Roaming/coding-provider-manager/
.cpm/

